    {
      "source": "Switches the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Thread.html#getContextClassLoader()\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>context ClassLoader</code></a> for the\nmanaged resources <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/ClassLoader.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>ClassLoader</code></a> before allowing the invocation to occur.",
