    {
      "source": "Extension of the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.management/javax/management/modelmbean/RequiredModelMBean.html\" title=\"class or interface in javax.management.modelmbean\"><code>RequiredModelMBean</code></a> class that ensures the\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Thread.html#getContextClassLoader()\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>thread context ClassLoader</code></a> is switched\nfor the managed resource's <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/ClassLoader.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>ClassLoader</code></a> before any invocations occur.",
      "translation": "扩展 `<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.management/javax/management/modelmbean/RequiredModelMBean.html\" title=\"class or interface in javax.management.modelmbean\"><code>RequiredModelMBean</code></a>` 类，确保在发生任何调用之前，将 `<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Thread.html#getContextClassLoader()\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>thread context ClassLoader</code></a>` 切换为受管资源的 `<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/ClassLoader.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>ClassLoader</code></a>`。",
